      "updated": 1783859515451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Whatsapp\nMessaging service allows you to send and receive messages from phone and computers.\nBuilt on Erlang, renowned for handling high scale.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Whatsapp\nMessaging service allows you to send and receive messages from phone and computers.\nBuilt on Erlang, renowned for handling high scale.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "O6MoKUh08FwY-c20pAVs5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -19102.06878328684,
      "y": -2177.744644884281,
      "width": 593.0795288085938,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 22381200,
      "version": 607,
      "versionNonce": 804846224,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783860006635,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- Start group chats (limit 100 users)\n- Send-receive messages\n- Send/receive media\n- Access messages after they've been offline (upto 30 days)\n\n------- Out of Scope -------\n- Audio/Video Calling\n- Interactions with business\n- Profile management\n\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n- Delivered with low-latency < 500ms\n- Guarantee delivery of messages\n- 1B users, high throughput\n- Message not stored unnecessarily\n- Fault-tolerant\n\n---- Out of Scope ------\n- spam protection",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- Start group chats (limit 100 users)\n- Send-receive messages\n- Send/receive media\n- Access messages after they've been offline (upto 30 days)\n\n------- Out of Scope -------\n- Audio/Video Calling\n- Interactions with business\n- Profile management\n\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n- Delivered with low-latency < 500ms\n- Guarantee delivery of messages\n- 1B users, high throughput\n- Message not stored unnecessarily\n- Fault-tolerant\n\n---- Out of Scope ------\n- spam protection",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
