      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783941168040,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "send/receive media\n- Don't accept media on chat server via websocket to be saved in our DynamoDB - Poor approach, DDB not for blobs, blocking websocket bandwidths\n- Upload media to chat server and let it upload to S3, to download use par to directly download to client - Poor, uploading twice, blocking bandwidth\n- user par directly to upload from client, client request server to upload, server using its SDK returns a par, client directly uploads... same as dropbox\n- expire media with TTL once received by all participant needs handling\n- Put CDN in front for Blob storage if group size is bigger to directly serve from there.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "send/receive media\n- Don't accept media on chat server via websocket to be saved in our DynamoDB - Poor approach, DDB not for blobs, blocking websocket bandwidths\n- Upload media to chat server and let it upload to S3, to download use par to directly download to client - Poor, uploading twice, blocking bandwidth\n- user par directly to upload from client, client request server to upload, server using its SDK returns a par, client directly uploads... same as dropbox\n- expire media with TTL once received by all participant needs handling\n- Put CDN in front for Blob storage if group size is bigger to directly serve from there.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
